<Base title='Campground Weekend editorial desk'><div class="container"><div class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">The publication</p><h1>Campground Weekend editorial desk</h1></div><article class="prose section"><p>The editorial desk prepares source-backed campground comparisons and practical trip plans for Campground Weekend, an independent publication from North Shore Family Adventures.</p><p>This byline identifies desk research. It does not claim that Tim Cigelske or another named writer personally stayed at a campground or tested a product. Future firsthand reports will identify the writer, visit dates and relevant limitations.</p><p>Read our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> or <a href="/contact/">send a correction</a>.</p></article></div></Base>
